+  tip_199: 'External memory providers: Honcho, OpenViking, Mem0 bundled; Hindsight and more via hermes plugins install.'
+  tip_200: Plugin hooks include pre/post_tool_call, pre/post_llm_call, and transform_terminal_output for output canonicalization.
