+  tip_208: 'Custom providers: save named endpoints in config.yaml under custom_providers.'
+  tip_209: HERMES_EPHEMERAL_SYSTEM_PROMPT injects a system prompt that's never persisted to history.
+  tip_210: credential_pool_strategies supports fill_first, round_robin, least_used, and random rotation.
+  tip_211: hermes auth add nous or hermes auth add openai-codex sets up OAuth-based providers.
+  tip_212: The API server supports both Chat Completions and Responses API with server-side state.
+  tip_213: 'tool_preview_length: 0 in config shows full file paths in the spinner''s activity feed.'
+  tip_214: hermes status --deep runs deeper diagnostic checks across all components.
+  tip_215: Cron jobs can attach a Python script (--script) whose stdout is injected into the prompt as context.
