+  tip_132: When exiting, Hermes prints a resume command with session ID and stats.
+  tip_133: hermes sessions export backup.jsonl exports all sessions for backup or analysis.
+  tip_134: hermes -r SESSION_ID resumes any specific past session by its ID.
+  tip_135: Memory is a frozen snapshot — changes appear in the system prompt only at next session start.
